{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# Input｜流程图\n上方：原native绑定→真实Action→能力请求／轴值；下方：原生出生、Source事实和移动装配。流程节点只讲触发、接口与结果。\nH Ready关联既有能力输入；映射重建装配移动；Closing与Released分别归还原资源，Source／CMC寿命独立。\nI1／X1／C2有限链路已验；X2未实施，联机／Cook／视觉／性能等未验。[[Input/结构#本轮复杂度整理与验证边界|实际验证与历史失败]]\n[[GGYGO_结构_输入与意图.canvas|结构图]] · [[Input/结构|结构文档]] · [[计划_输入与意图|计划]] · [[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|连段]]","x":0,"y":0,"width":1900,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"move","type":"text","text":"移动：核原Scope／Session／Binding，Source GetRequest真held才按原yaw AddMovementInput。\n视角：原Controller yaw/pitch。\n轴零不等于释放；均不走ASC。\n[[Movement/结构]]","x":1430,"y":216,"width":420,"height":230,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ability","type":"text","text":"Input_AbilityActionTriggered：首Triggered先锁存Observation／有限绝对deadline，再ReceiveAbilityInputRequest原ASC ID。\n未Ready／拒绝仍锁存；重复Triggered／Ready／重绑不以空Previous补发或续期。\nInput_AbilityActionReleased：真实Completed/Canceled结束原Action；匹配原H时EndAbilityInputRequest(Released)，无deadline门禁；失效exact Invalidated。\n首Receive返栈迟到ID仍退原ASC。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|原请求权威]]","x":1430,"y":743,"width":420,"height":310,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"consume","type":"text","text":"4. 原PlayerController PostProcessInput(dt,paused)→ASC ProcessAbilityInput。\nASC取原边沿／有限重试，花掉旧许可后调用TryActivateAbilityWithTerminationBoundary；原生GAS执行。\n同Spec本次Process至多一次，无第二Tick；deadline不代替真实held释放。","x":950,"y":945,"width":400,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"retry","type":"text","text":"真实Try/Can Queued失败→ASC先提交原请求/Spec许可与等待→Super失败观察；Retryable通知在返栈重验后。\nGroupFreed→WakeQueuedAbilityInputRequests快照并消费原等待集→仅排下次Process。\n重复notice原位；候选消费后仅新真实失败再入尾。无Tag猜配／续期／内联Try。\nHero无缓冲／生产订阅。\n[[GGYGO_流程_能力仲裁.canvas|仲裁]]","x":1430,"y":1269,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"prepare","type":"text","text":"A. Hero B2真实映射重建装配\nInitialize先持原Scope／薄Observer再添加自身IMC；真实ControlMappingsRebuilt且自身注册记录齐备才进入。H Ready不是前置，Add返回／Triggered不Begin。\n重检原Scope→退原Session/Binding→原CMC serial→Source Begin并持Session→CMC Bind CAS并保存Binding→Attach。\nBegin仅准备；Attach显式Opened，不造Neutral／Unresolved，重复Attach不替换。\nCold资格来自原出生资源，跨Producer缺转交拒绝。失败／晚返回只退原局部资源，不清重入后继。\nGate59编译，正式装配动态未验。\n[[Input/结构#Hero移动来源装配与精确退出（B2）|B2接口]]","x":0,"y":2520,"width":570,"height":530,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"observe","type":"text","text":"B. 原生事实→Movement投影\nInputKey捕原Producer/Session→Observe唯一raw/Revision→Project只读事实/自身义务→Super一次→重检原观察／路由。\nCold真实有效设备首数字Press；会话前held／Repeat／模拟／不完整轴不借Cold。\nUpdateRequestFromSource核原路由→CommitPhysicalRequest提交原Request/Event→Consume原Claim→Started；成功Consume无外调，本栈资格复用。交付外调后仍核原weak／Session；失败无Started、不复用号。\nUnknown不自行复活；真Neutral先封原Released/Neutral再同步交付。\nEnd/Adopt仅Movement屏障；数字真release及必要轴真零起始均晚于边界。真实Flush记缺口，合成松键不恢复。\nGate59编译；正式物理链未验。\n[[Input/结构#原生观察与Movement义务分离|事实与义务]]","x":670,"y":2520,"width":570,"height":530,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"dispatch","type":"text","text":"C. 原事实交付与CMC唯一执行\nHero Receiver固定原Session／Binding／弱Scope／原CMC，验证双身份后直交Consume；回调不收养后继。\nCMC核原Binding／事件／ModeProof；Cold一次且不解FAILED，Rearm仍真Neutral。Recorded不等于执行成功。\n实际新Request才由CMC分配执行身份；Recorded执行失败保留原请求及真实释放链，不退资源自动重试。\nSessionInvalidated清原槽；匹配协议Rejected/Stale退原资源。End原Session／Invalidate原Binding不构成物理Released。\nGate59已编译，正式Hero移动／MoveData／Run未验，无第二帧调度器。","x":1340,"y":2520,"width":560,"height":530,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"origin","type":"text","text":"0. 初次资格／原生出生链｜D7已编译，D8～D10源码冻结已Gate44编译、夹具已验／正式出生未验\n真实LocalPlayer.Added捕获原Controller→Super→OriginResource.InitializeFromPlayerAdded。资源由宿主保有；未登记Controller通知会退休，不特判授Cold。\nController.InitInputSystem：Idle→Running；先验证真实配置或已有对象实际类，获取原资源→BeginNativeCreation(原Controller,配置类)→捕获原Ticket→Super一次。\nD10已实现：原生NewObject内PlayerInput.PostInitProperties捕获原关系→Super→重验→RecordNativeCreatedProducer；CDO／模板和无LP不登记，缺本地依赖明确诊断。默认类已切项目类，Blueprint Override待验。原生赋槽后D9完整重验原关系／配置／对象→Complete，缺Record明确MissingConstructionWitness，不把创建成功冒充资格成功。\n所有早退只Close原票据；失效／销毁后不写Controller。嵌套Running返回Busy、不Super／不排队；非暂态Rejected锁存至Actor结束，纠正依赖后重新创建，不由Tick自动重试。无LP原生路径不授资格。\nD12-B Source已编码：GetQualification／Claim只认领；实际首Request提交后、Started外调前Consume。End／flush／路由失效须Retire，Removed／Destroy封闭生命周期。Cold首个真实按下已批准，Rearm仍真实释放再按；跨Producer物理快照转交仍未接；Hero B2装配已随Gate59编译、正式输入未验，联机dummy语义待决。\nD11仅共享Mode／Proof值已Gate45编译；CMC校验／Cold一次窗口Gate48合成专项通过；Source D12-B发行已冻结／根静态接受，Gate49R1已编译／夹具已验／正式Source未验。","x":0,"y":1750,"width":1900,"height":660,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"hero-local-asc-prepare","type":"text","text":"## 原H通知／能力输入关联\nBeginPlay先持原订阅→RegisterLocalAbilitySystemNoticeAndCall；Ready认证原H／实际PublishedContext，再AssociateReadyAbilitySystemWithInput关联既有native Session。\n输入后建立则在Initialize尾部关联；Refreshed同H不重建输入／观察或延长期限。H Ready不装配Source／CMC。\nWithdraw先摘槽或EndPlay先关准入→原H一次Closing（空Context），不证明nativeCancel/Clear成功；Closed Released不广播。\n原记录退订／晚返回token只归自身；旧H不消费后继。\n[[Input/结构#Hero本地ASC身份订阅与原H清理|H接口与清理]]","x":0,"y":3190,"width":1900,"height":330,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"cleanup","type":"text","text":"## 原资源精确退出｜Closing／Released／自身Release\nClosing：匹配原Subscription/H→先RetireAbilityInputAssociation及原observations→End各原SourceASC ID Invalidated；无需旧H仍Ready。保留独立native Session／bind／IMC／活动Action首观察，原H／弱Session来源留至真实归还，不猜Camera／Source／CMC清理。\nReleased：捕原H／native Session／Pawn／Camera与代次→撤H及弱来源→仅所属native范围ReleasePlayerInput；否则只退原关联。汇合核原记录、H空、预期native槽／代次与镜头代次后清原overrides并Reset入口原Camera，后继变化停止旧尾部。\n自身Release：先摘并退休原native Session／Scope／Observer／Action／H关联，封存原ID；ForceWalk=false→退原Source Session／CMC Binding→exact End原ID→移除原native binds／自身IMC。外调不收养后继。\n协议Rejected/Stale只退原资源；CMC Recorded执行失败仍保留原请求／真释放链，生命周期失效不造物理Released。\n[[Input/结构#Hero移动来源装配与精确退出（B2）|移动资源归还]] · [[Input/结构#Hero本地ASC身份订阅与原H清理|原H与Action契约]]","x":0,"y":3660,"width":1900,"height":360,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"action","type":"text","text":"1. Pawn Setup或Hero DataInitialized进入原生初始化。\n两入口消费ConsumeLocalCameraProviderReady；DataInitialized已核后进private native core，Setup经public InitializePlayerInput。\n同栈复用，不保存跨帧Ready；Camera执行权不变。","x":-480,"y":378,"width":385,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"map","type":"text","text":"2. InitializePlayerInputBindings验证配置／来源后持原FPlayerInputSession与native句柄、自身IMC。\nMove lambda捕原Scope；Look/ForceWalk原Native回调；Ability绑原Action的Triggered／Completed／Canceled。\n退出只还自身原来源。","x":280,"y":378,"width":400,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"branch","type":"text","text":"3. EnhancedInput真实Action触发原绑定→Hero分流。\nInput_Move(instance,原Scope)／Input_LookMouse/Stick；能力原Action回调。\nInjected／Chord／Combo允许；Action结束不证明Movement物理释放，旧回调不收养后继。","x":720,"y":378,"width":385,"height":230,"color":"5"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"action","fromSide":"right","toNode":"map","toSide":"left","label":"原入口认证后建立自身native Session／绑定"},
		{"id":"e2","fromNode":"map","fromSide":"right","toNode":"branch","toSide":"left","label":"绑定安装后由真实EnhancedInput Action回调进入"},
		{"id":"e3","fromNode":"branch","fromSide":"right","toNode":"move","toSide":"left","label":"Move经原Source GetRequest；Look原Controller入口"},
		{"id":"e4","fromNode":"branch","fromSide":"right","toNode":"ability","toSide":"left","label":"原Action观察→Receive/End原ID"},
		{"id":"e5","fromNode":"ability","fromSide":"right","toNode":"consume","toSide":"left","label":"PostProcessInput → ProcessAbilityInput"},
		{"id":"e6","fromNode":"consume","fromSide":"right","toNode":"retry","toSide":"left","label":"真实Queued失败→ASC提交原许可／等待；组释放只排下次Process"},
		{"id":"e7","fromNode":"prepare","fromSide":"right","toNode":"observe","toSide":"left","label":"原装配完成→原Session参与真实观察"},
		{"id":"e8","fromNode":"observe","fromSide":"right","toNode":"dispatch","toSide":"left","label":"Receiver原Binding与原Fact；不冒充准入"},
		{"id":"e9","fromNode":"origin","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"prepare","toSide":"top","label":"原出生资格供Source Begin选择Cold/Rearm；不证明执行"},
		{"id":"e-hero-local-asc-prepare","fromNode":"hero-local-asc-prepare","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"cleanup","toSide":"top","label":"原H Closing精确退ID；真实Released按原来源归还native／镜头"},
		{"id":"e-prepare-cleanup","fromNode":"prepare","fromSide":"left","toNode":"cleanup","toSide":"left","label":"Begin/Bind/Attach失败：只退原局部资源"},
		{"id":"e-dispatch-cleanup","fromNode":"dispatch","fromSide":"right","toNode":"cleanup","toSide":"right","label":"协议Rejected/Stale或原SessionInvalidated：原资源清理"}
	]
}
